WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:55.188 --> 00:01:00.193
Woke up to the sound of pouring rain

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:07.600
Should be fine.
I'll just go back to sleep

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:26.586
Woke up again.
Rainwater is coming in

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:33.193
Probably raining too hard
for the ground to drain fast enough

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:43.103
So the spots with no leaves
are actually the low-lying areas

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:50.643
Because standing water washes the leaves away,
leaving the bare ground exposed

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:58.551
Luckily, the military tarp's water resistance
is still holding up

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:08.428
Right now, water is pooling on the left.
The leafy side on the right is fine

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:17.604
The moment I turned on my headlamp,
flying ants came right back

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:23.877
Good thing I tossed the headlamp aside.
They really love white light

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:28.114
This is rough

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:35.622
What?

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:40.627
Why does my back feel so cold?
Oh, it's morning already

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:49.469
The rain is getting even heavier

00:02:50.804 --> 00:02:55.809
Oh no...
water is flowing in from behind

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:08.121
It's cutting straight through the tent nonstop

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:40.320
I'm in trouble

00:03:41.488 --> 00:03:46.493
Move the valuables into the inner tent first

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:52.232
The inner tent has a raised tub floor
to block the water

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:57.437
Use the tripod to help improve drainage

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:07.914
About 2 cm of flooding

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:27.670
Time to refuel with breakfast

00:04:56.290 --> 00:05:01.340
Bread and canned coffee.
Both are ready-to-eat

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:07.607
I usually buy stuff like this.
Easy to eat outdoors anytime

00:05:09.109 --> 00:05:14.114
Plastic bags are truly a great invention

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.760
It poured hard for three straight hours

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:36.803
After three nonstop hours,
the rain is finally letting up

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:43.476
New tent owners can come test waterproofing
at Yingda in summer

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:50.500
The rain is lighter now,
and the water is slowly receding

00:05:52.585 --> 00:05:57.590
The little river keeps flowing

00:06:13.373 --> 00:06:18.378
All the water is passing right under my home

00:07:10.764 --> 00:07:15.769
Time for something hot

00:07:15.869 --> 00:07:20.874
Hope the ST-310 didn't get damp

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:37.900
Bought this during a 7-Eleven buy-one-get-one deal

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:48.535
The shallow pan from the BUNDOK cook set
fits perfectly

00:08:17.597 --> 00:08:22.602
Most deep-and-shallow pan sets on the market
stack like this

00:08:28.575 --> 00:08:33.580
Don't turn the flame too high,
or the silicone grip will get damaged

00:08:43.656 --> 00:08:48.661
This camp meal is simple too.
Just noodles that only need hot water

00:09:18.258 --> 00:09:28.680
Nissin cup noodle packaging is as creative
as their ads

00:09:56.696 --> 00:10:01.701
Rich broth.
Worth around NT$50 to 60

00:10:45.945 --> 00:10:50.950
Seeing all these leaves piled up
behind the tent

00:10:52.252 --> 00:10:57.257
you can tell how powerful the runoff was

00:11:25.251 --> 00:11:30.256
Jiaming slept in a hammock,
so flooding wasn't an issue

00:11:34.928 --> 00:11:39.933
Jiaming is heading out for breakfast later

00:11:46.573 --> 00:11:51.578
After a chaotic night,
time to pack up the tent

00:11:53.146 --> 00:11:58.151
My first time camping on a lazy river

00:12:14.968 --> 00:12:22.175
Two months without camping,
and that 'too comfy to go home' feeling is back

00:12:22.575 --> 00:12:27.580
A slow Sunday morning

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:35.855
First time getting a river
running straight through camp

00:13:14.361 --> 00:13:19.366
Same vibe, same kind of favorite campsites

00:13:41.721 --> 00:13:46.726
Solo camping lovers

00:13:51.865 --> 00:13:56.870
It's 10 o'clock.
Time to fly the AntiGravity A1

00:13:57.137 --> 00:14:02.800
⚠ Flying too early can disturb other campers

00:14:02.709 --> 00:14:07.714
Yingda Farm is wide open,
with a 60-meter altitude limit

00:14:16.122 --> 00:14:21.127
Simple and easy to get the hang of

00:14:24.798 --> 00:14:29.803
Push twice to take off
to the 1.2-meter standby position

00:14:30.236 --> 00:14:35.241
Oh yeah~
Then just pull up and climb

00:14:35.742 --> 00:14:40.747
The landing gear retracts automatically
so it won't show in the shot

00:14:47.787 --> 00:14:52.792
Liding Mountain,
where I once hiked with my wife and kid

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:05.710
Yingda's big lawn area
and the floating clouds above

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.109
Any spot with muddy marks
can flood like this

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:44.770
The flatland forest has a unique vibe,
with roads perfect for riding

00:16:09.936 --> 00:16:14.941
Solar panels...
nope, not today

00:16:15.575 --> 00:16:20.580
Waiting for the little aircraft to return

00:16:24.217 --> 00:16:29.222
FPV goggles.
Wherever I turn, that's what I see

00:16:29.222 --> 00:16:32.580
I turn

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:38.965
Soaring and circling
on the wings of an eagle

00:16:38.965 --> 00:16:43.970
Subarashii

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:48.975
Preparing to land

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:54.948
Pingtung Tower, A1,
established runway 01 Left.

00:16:55.648 --> 00:17:00.653
Tower: Cleared to land

00:17:01.821 --> 00:17:06.826
A1: Cleared to land

00:17:06.826 --> 00:17:11.831
Continue landing, A1

00:17:18.271 --> 00:17:23.276
A1, welcome to Pingtung.

00:17:23.276 --> 00:17:28.281
It's getting late.
Time to wrap up this rainy trip

00:17:28.281 --> 00:17:33.286
My first visit was on New Year's Day, 2015

00:17:35.355 --> 00:17:40.360
For the past 10 years,
I've always camped near this tree, even without power

00:17:41.261 --> 00:17:46.266
I feel like camping was wilder 10 years ago.
People used to pitch here too

00:17:46.266 --> 00:17:49.200
Ten years later,
everyone is still here

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.538
Familiar campsites just hit different

00:17:51.538 --> 00:17:54.708
A classic campground
that really feels like an old companion

00:17:54.708 --> 00:17:58.712
Do you also have an old campground
that feels like an old companion?

